{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":34,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":34,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/avatar.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""},{"id":383,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/avatar.png","skin":"泳装","skin_cn":"泳装"}],"family_name":"槌永","given_name":"日和","family_name_jp":"槌永","given_name_jp":"ヒヨリ","family_name_kr":"츠치나가","given_name_kr":"히요리","family_name_en":"Tsuchinaga","given_name_en":"Hiyori","family_name_zh_tw":"槌永","given_name_zh_tw":"日和","family_name_cn":"槌永","given_name_cn":"日和","nick_name":"黑暗初音，纳米肚肚","momo_talk_signature":"人生，就是苦痛的持续......","main_relation":42,"relation":[5,14],"age":16,"grade":"二年生","height":155,"birthday":"01-08","hobby":"收集杂志","designer":"9ml","illustrator":"9ml","character_voice":"中原麻衣","character_voice_cn":"降温","release_date":"2022-05-24","release_date_cn":"2024-05-16","release_date_global":"2022-12-20","school":10,"weapon_type":"SR","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":true,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Medium","special_appearance":false,"spine":[290,471],"model":[34,388],"voice":[{"description":"Hiyori_Title","category":"lobby","text":"诶、嘿嘿……Blue Archive.","text_original":"えへへ……ブルーアーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/EXfOTtNgizCfllHLgVlzg4ZLCfkBO9XC.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"诶、嘿嘿……打扰了。","text_original":"えへへ。失礼します……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/uSG6YtcOr5tFtGpDe7alMHWXW5jA9C7K.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"这里，有不少看起来很不错的家具呢……","text_original":"何だか良さそうな家具が、たくさん……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/Vy3irl945mvdrkYrHIZqeDYEVBOjxczf.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"这个，还有那个，真不错呀~有这么多好东西！","text_original":"あれも、これも……良いですね……良さそうなものがたくさん……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/wM7MUtqBt3wQjKP8Ws80roLzBieY506h.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"诶、嘿嘿……我太没礼数了。抱歉。","text_original":"えへへ……ご迷惑をおかけします、すみません……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/igfzZivl5JeNGHrhfpsKS5Gx3fTDmO5O.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"好像变开心了一点，又好像没有……","text_original":"楽しい気分になれそうな……なれなさそうな……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/3g4riwiiT7x14BXT09Dcji0OFfpQ7GB9.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_CommonSkill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"会…会很痛吧？","text_original":"い、痛そうですね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/NdUa1VVP2LBfGHb9sLhorF3ujUDk11Ud.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"哦，呃哇啊啊——我，我来了！","text_original":"お、おぅわぁ！わ、私が行きます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/cZv1e6XBtdKJoPVVGjbXKJ4OdFTyc1iF.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"我……欸? 稍……稍等一下……！","text_original":"うぅぅ……えっ！？しょ、少々お待ちを！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/lGi0QvNtriB7fbp7V3isD3w77wsV8w4m.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"各……各位……啊……我，我来支援了……！","text_original":"み、皆さん……？はっ！？し、支援します！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/JKL0prFM99XKbo3s39FMpMLeW9Hkkq40.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"嗯,嘿嘿嘿,我也就只会这些了。","text_original":"えへへ……私には、このくらいしか出来ないので……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/DKQZIcOQnokx4T0uAtQlREUkwe9YYuIG.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"那，那么，前往下个地点吧……","text_original":"で……ではまた、次の場所へ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/tGDDx3mCjlouU4QqbsCt7fybnXvCRLbN.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"这……也是人生……","text_original":"こういうのも……人生ですよね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/FJ3fKbewvfUg44YpqC2InviYt8ddnqvL.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"老师是想狠狠压榨我吧？唉……反正也没别的办法，只能接受了。嘿嘿嘿……","text_original":"先生は私を、骨の髄までこき使うつもりなんですね…… まあ、どうしようもありませんし……受け入れるとしましょう、えへへ……。　","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/Py5zy0iTBY9amuKcPdwtlz7C6hyoYziJ.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"是的,我准备好了,请……多多关照。","text_original":"はい、準備できました。よろしくお願いします......","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/Ps9wyUSXATuJwoDaTa3xrbcrAxVpaiWe.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"诶、嘿嘿……这，这次……是什么样的工作……","text_original":"えへへ……こ、今回はどんなお仕事で……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/HH0pZa7rOtSLoTK8LQsbslXeRfpvevhL.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"诶嘿嘿……我终于也来这里了。接下来一定会很累、很辛苦吧？但这就是人生……也没办法吧？我是日和，请多关照……诶、嘿嘿。","text_original":"えへへ……何だかんだで、来てしまいました……これからも辛いですよね？苦しいんですよね？ ですが、それが人生のようですし……仕方ないですね。ヒヨリです、よろしくお願いいたします……えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/yFnMu3F4mbqAqrK1OC0saJzbq7cPAJUk.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"啊？给，给我的吗？也就是说，想让我更痛苦，是这个意思吧？","text_original":"へ？わ、私ですか！？つまり、もっと苦しめと……そういうことですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/jiFpaySdDaQIs6ot4rsVIY1XqvfTpMHT.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"以后会更痛苦吧……虽然会越来越痛苦……不过这也没办法呢，欸嘿嘿嘿……","text_original":"この先は、もっと苦しいんですよね……どんどん辛くなるんでしょうけど……仕方ないですね……えへへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/tvNF4BC8g0dx3z7mCbRe4xTdgwXQHPiV.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"随着我越来越强,应该，也会比现在更痛苦吧……","text_original":"強くなればなるほど、今以上に苦しむんですよね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/m0sDmvrzkygPUgq0ZhwZk5E3BFliF8hG.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"就算卑微如我，也能派上用场吗？","text_original":"こんな私でも、役に立てることが……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/HhIktGNBsY8vj2TKln0e9zmRr4PTukgA.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"如果有什么事情，就告诉我……没准我可以帮上您什么忙……","text_original":"何かあれば言ってください……内容によっては、もしかしたら役に……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/UTntRi8V86rOQRHjRTvR4KAWkeR7f0Ck.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Lobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"我说，就没有什么需要我做的事情吗……？从刚才开始就只是一起呆着而已…… 有没有更辛苦的工作之类的……","text_original":"あの、何かやることなどは……？さっきからただ一緒にいるだけで…… もっと何か、苦しい仕事とか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/kOBCy4ZteOQzqV11EtaSwhzikSKiHfJT.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Lobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？真的吗？只要继续这样呆着就可以吗？","text_original":"……はい？こうしているだけでいいんですか？……本当に？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/jTTZ2hz2IKdvejAWXMykAtMTnaHjWYGj.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"最近，我在杂志上读到过各种各样的文章…… 诶嘿嘿，或许能帮上一些忙……","text_original":"この間、そういう雑誌で色々読んできましたので。 えへへ……何か役に立てるかもです……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/wy4s3IXQFccNOIyE9yVjCfEFtK1eyGIH.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"工作，虽然很辛苦…… 但人生本来就是辛苦的。所以没关系。","text_original":"お仕事は、苦しいですが…… 人生は元々全てが苦しいので、大丈夫です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/DLHx36CkbYNhOQcK27C4NZCBRIgRwKFL.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"呜，呜哇啊？！欢，欢迎您，老师…… 等，等候您多时了。","text_original":"うわぁっ！？お、おかえりなさい、先生…… お、お待ちしておりました……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/cmWTYldTsd2qnoxaZC1OTNLyJZu9maUI.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"诶，嘿嘿……没错，这次值日员是我。所以老师大概会吃点苦吧。","text_original":"えへへ……はい、お嫌かもしれませんが、本日の当番は私です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/qSXG505LeOM8Nlyf3Rmhb60C6kx557sE.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"み、見てください先生、私のここ……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/BuKd2OpOaAl3FseMzGSqj2qtnnVmiOgx.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"や、やっぱり変なんですよね？みんなと違うんですよね！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/TeMJembO6MdtxWS89pGyN888qy9jL61A.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"もしかして変なのではと、前から思ってはいましたが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/Y7JJA6WVGEdPbTupUqdzs3M49tnqZan0.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_2_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"やっぱり、そうだったんですね……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/A5JGEkUGqZ8NhlyQz0G8cwAHTkFSa57X.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"せ、先生？どうしてさっきから、視線を……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/vXd6IRQJvwu0NZCggyW1nGlpVUAw8RUP.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"まさか……ま、まともに見られないくらい変なんですか！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/WhvZtiYwr0oIJH4amfWevSl7iEAmflni.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"そうなんですね……もう生きていく意味もないかもしれません","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/soCBomp34hSbMXfgkXzlxII95LVm7I8J.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"どうして人生は、こう……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/nxSS4YVpi962QAYMEozWoyyjGKNxFh3n.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_4_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"まるで直視できない私のここみたいに、グロテスクで……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/LqylndAyzFPdz4q4qiDKBrYjo5A6dLNN.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"せ、先生……せめて何か感想を……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/Xvn7zCVIaWqHJS3q5kfQKruBhP83kFvz.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"こんな体でも、良いとか役立ちそうとか、何か言っていただけないと……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/ajvIq1rkpOrF68C9qBguDncPxd24cLl2.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"啊……怎么说呢……虽然我觉得自己的用处也就到这里了，但，这是怎么回事呢……","text_original":"あの…私、これ以上はきっと役に立てないと思いますが……。どうしたものですかね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/7WJ0ZSAlckiZ0OaEt6eF7w6S11ptIQfO.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"谢……谢谢你……欸嘿嘿……","text_original":"あ、ありがとうございます…。えへへ…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/41kWgMRRZwNZMVPiomccBDrYYPDBIAuN.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"您这样推着我向前走，是想告诉我，“人生就是受苦”吧？对吧？是这样的吧？","text_original":"こんなに私を追い詰めて。人生は苦しいものだって教えて下さってるんですか？そうですよね？そういうことですよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/eG3JwQjixHg764xCjM5qjd1Yk36tDDWt.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"夸奖，然后再贬低，以此让我陷入痛苦……原来是这个套路吗……？","text_original":"上げては落として……また、つらい目に…。そういうことですよね？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/KHcfVgtlk9LU7q6bvNM1Kv3PO5ExNMB4.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"人是为了受苦才出生的，不是吗？ 嘿嘿……所以我这些年的人生非常充实。 诶？您说这个论调太扭曲了？是，是吗？","text_original":"人は、苦しむために生まれるんですよね？ へへ……ですから私はもう何年も、充実した年を重ねています。 そ、それは違うかも……？そうなんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/bAjVQ2BYF0sWQFdc6SpXWeqL1zsq65kd.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"祝，祝老师生日快乐！！ 老师一直在不停重复着如此痛苦的时光吗？ 真了不起，太厉害了。 我虽然也很痛苦……但以后会加油的。","text_original":"せ、先生、誕生日おめでとうございます！！ こんな辛い時間を先生は何度も繰り返してきたんですよね？ すごいですね、本当に素晴らしいです。 私も辛いですが……これからも、頑張ります。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/oOohsmUg4YTJOwiu6BsPul5T0FMCBWxq.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿……不管是被夺走糖果还是被捣蛋…… 选哪一个，结果都是痛苦的……就像我们的人生一样。","text_original":"えへへ……飴を奪われるか、いたずらされるか……どっちでも辛いですよね。 どっちを選んでも苦しい二者択一……人生みたいですね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/okuPHGuPJ4qGtUGFsA1HzRKa6FaUvJlG.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"一年又这样过去了呢。 新的一年又会有怎样的新苦等着我吃呢……嘿嘿嘿。","text_original":"またこうして一年が過ぎましたね。 今年は新たに、どれだけの苦しみが待っていることでしょうか……えへへ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/X0bfbCkyUr5JpU6Ww6razenLIWsprxwJ.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，我在杂志上学过关于圣诞节的知识，准备可以说是万无一失…… ……咦？您为什么要逃跑？","text_original":"聖夜について雑誌で読みました。色々と準備は万端です。 ……えっと、どうして逃げようとするんですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/NzD72oYDiTAARwRWNwuPQadn47xMwdJV.ogg"},{"description":"Hiyori_MemorialLobby_0","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/Hiyori_MemorialLobby_0.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"诶、嘿嘿……打扰了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这里，有不少看起来很不错的家具呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"这个，还有那个，真不错呀~有这么多好东西！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"诶、嘿嘿……我太没礼数了。抱歉。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"好像变开心了一点，又好像没有……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"会…会很痛吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"哦，呃哇啊啊——我，我来了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"我……欸? 稍……稍等一下……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"各……各位……啊……我，我来支援了……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"嗯,嘿嘿嘿,我也就只会这些了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"那，那么，前往下个地点吧……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"这……也是人生……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"老师是想狠狠压榨我吧？唉……反正也没别的办法，只能接受了。嘿嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"是的,我准备好了,请……多多关照。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"呃,嘿嘿……这，这次……是什么样的工作……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"诶嘿嘿……我终于也来这里了。接下来一定会很累、很辛苦吧？但这就是人生……也没办法吧？我是日和，请多关照……诶、嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"啊？给，给我的吗？也就是说，想让我更痛苦，是这个意思吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"以后会更痛苦吧……虽然会越来越痛苦……不过这也没办法呢，欸嘿嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"随着我越来越强,应该，也会比现在更痛苦吧……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"就算卑微如我，也能派上用场吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"如果有什么事情，就告诉我……没准我可以帮上您什么忙……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"我说，就没有什么需要我做的事情吗……？从刚才开始就只是一起呆着而已…… 有没有更辛苦的工作之类的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"嗯？真的吗？只要继续这样呆着就可以吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"最近，我在杂志上读到过各种各样的文章…… 诶嘿嘿，或许能帮上一些忙……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"工作，虽然很辛苦…… 但人生本来就是辛苦的。所以没关系。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜，呜哇啊？！欢，欢迎您，老师…… 等，等候您多时了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"诶，嘿嘿……没错，这次值日员是我。所以老师大概会吃点苦吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"老，老师，您看呀。我这里……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"是不是，很奇怪？和其他人不一样吧？！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"我以前就一直在想，自己的肚脐是不是有些奇怪……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"呜……果然，是这样的！！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师？您的视线为什么总是闪开啊？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"难道……已经奇怪到无法直视的地步了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"哇啊啊啊啊——果然是这样……这么一来，我已经没有活下去的意义了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"为什么我的人生……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"会像我这里一样不忍直视，这么丑陋畸形呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿……老师，至少说句安慰的话吧……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"就算身体长得奇怪，也会有它的用处之类的，这样安慰我一下可以吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"啊……怎么说呢……虽然我觉得自己的用处也就到这里了，但，这是怎么回事呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"谢……谢谢你……欸嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"您这样推着我向前走，是想告诉我，“人生就是受苦”吧？对吧？是这样的吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"夸奖，然后再贬低，以此让我陷入痛苦……原来是这个套路吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"人是为了受苦才出生的，不是吗？ 嘿嘿……所以我这些年的人生非常充实。 诶？您说这个论调太扭曲了？是，是吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"祝，祝老师生日快乐！！ 老师一直在不停重复着如此痛苦的时光吗？ 真了不起，太厉害了。 我虽然也很痛苦……但以后会加油的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，新春我也会受苦的吧？啊？新春快乐？哎呀，快乐只是一时的，受苦才是长久远……欸…嘿嘿……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿……不管是被夺走糖果还是被捣蛋…… 选哪一个，结果都是痛苦的……就像我们的人生一样。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"月饼？啊，我知道了，里面一定藏了魔鬼辣椒，是用来让我受苦的新道ju——诶？没放那么危险的东西？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"一年又这样过去了呢。 新的一年又会有怎样的新苦等着我吃呢……嘿嘿嘿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"嘿嘿，我在杂志上学过关于圣诞节的知识，准备可以说是万无一失…… ……咦？您为什么要逃跑？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_title","category":"lobby","text":"诶、嘿嘿……Blue Archive.","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/cn/hiyori_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A7%8C%E6%B0%B8%20%E6%97%A5%E5%92%8C/original/hiyori_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"hiyori_lobby_2_2","catego